{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your INVENTORIX device\u00a0(crafted by space gnomes) to extract maximum value from interstellar items and recruit aliens to boost your earnings. Pay off a mysterious debt or push your luck to create astronomical wealth. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2500460/extras/13c9939f4a2e61be04f2adb54dc9cd0b.poster.avif?t=1772416218\" width=320 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2500460/extras/13c9939f4a2e61be04f2adb54dc9cd0b.webm?t=1772416218\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2500460/extras/13c9939f4a2e61be04f2adb54dc9cd0b.mp4?t=1772416218\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Galactic profits</strong>: Earn cosmic cash, ka-ching, ka-ching, ka-ching!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inventory Management</strong>: Pack items and aliens to uncover powerful combos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>95+ Items</strong>: Pick them wisely.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>150+ Alien Perks</strong>: Which ones best support your build?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>15+ Item Classes</strong>: Go all-in on a single class or mix them up for cosmic synergies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Roguelike:</strong> Fast, replayable runs packed with variety.<strong> </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>10 INVENTORIX Devices</strong>: Unlock them and explore unique strategies with each. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>20 Difficulty Levels</strong>: Conquer escalating challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boss Encounter</strong>: Dubious Space Loan Sharks to defeat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Mode</strong>: How far can your build go?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Codex: </strong>Complete your Codex by identifying new items and aliens.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Exact Payment 1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2500460/14d89c0fb6b66cf9181914f6337dcafa9bf7348e.jpg"},{"name":"Exact Payment 2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2500460/694baaee8ec0de22d0999fc510e9bdb8d97115f1.jpg"},{"name":"Exact Payment 3","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2500460/80793724eb15f4e6dcd41a77434078845bb8ff5b.jpg"},{"name":"Exact Payment 4","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2500460/e68722f1f7d7efa20c8209b715bdf3d32efadfd8.jpg"},{"name":"Exact Payment 5","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2500460/ceb90e1ea967dbb023b4351fbe3925df8a689cf5.jpg"},{"name":"Exact Payment 6","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2500460/6e501f1b622784db7851b94af463d1e640f9d115.jpg"},{"name":"Exact Payment 7","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2500460/264ec6b9449d285cd7c233c70ea107e5e39d1358.jpg"},{"name":"Exact Payment 8","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2500460/9e07047884eeb5e417e362cddc404dceada52b85.jpg"},{"name":"Exact Payment Boss","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2500460/04408dfea1a755db245ab3f5c7fb8c9d141e26f8.jpg"},{"name":"Device #0 Victory","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2500460/0aa64041054b2ffca75226498f430307dee915f0.jpg"}],"total":39},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2500460?t=177